  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing dignity and well-being of vulnerable older people through the provision of essential Non-Food Items (NFIs) in Dnipropetrovsk Oblast, Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Protection-based assistance for older women and men, including older people with disabilities in Dnipropetrovsk Oblast</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the proposed initiative is to contribute to the improved dignity and well-being of vulnerable older people, with or without disabilities, through the provision of essential NFIs. By addressing the critical NFI needs of displaced and marginalized older men and women affected by the conflict, the project aims to contribute to their enhanced health, dignity, and overall improved living conditions.</narrative>
  </description>
